    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk im just really scared to go to the er because of the cost and the wait times... it's kinda going away now, it's just a dull ache. do u think its really that serious? could it just be from stress or like bad dehydration? i have some advil here, should i just take a few of those and see if it settles down?",
